{"id":"0f1db95b853d761e","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Iterable Premouse","display":"df-zfc-iterable-premouse — ZFC Iterable Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-iterable-premouse — ZFC Iterable Premouse","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-iterable-premouse — ZFC Iterable Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0134626c9734e3cd\" href=\"?note=0134626c9734e3cd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (premouse code and iteration-length bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E\">\\(\\vec E\\)</span> (extender-sequence witness) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (iteration-strategy witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\)</span> (canonical premouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\">\\(\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\\)</span> (well-founded-branch strategy predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0134626c9734e3cd\" href=\"?note=0134626c9734e3cd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iterable\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\exists\\vec E,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iterable\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\exists\\vec E,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bounded iterability is witnessed by one coherent strategy selecting a well-founded cofinal branch at every limit-length tree in its domain.</li>\n<li>Quantifying independently over all completed iteration-tree codes would be too strong and would lose the coherence that distinguishes a strategy from unrelated branch choices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S$ (canonical premouse predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}$ (well-founded-branch strategy predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iterable\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\exists\\vec E,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1653,"backlinks":[{"id":"203f765d44ea3c39","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S$ (bounded iterability predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]])"},{"id":"6a9f025c62cc8d1a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse.md]])"},{"id":"b89c7b657207c8cd","anchor":"ref-5",